aligned}\n$$\n\nThe matching diagram has a right-and-down arrow from each of the first two points and an upward arrow from $(0,-2)$, with the displayed component displacements."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186172286 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f19d19af-b717-5081-be6e-62e25a75c568" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/4d/4d3b3c7f1a3b85e40cec4392b4c487c5423636837ea2672c6cdcd6fdeb2b0cc7.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186380707} {:answer/id #uuid "b54cebe4-6aa6-502d-9b98-b267d3c2bb70" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/33/33c6c3680f3cab38ffd1508fad160948f3bc1159c01dc287b3fe113c0cf89875.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186380708} {:answer/id #uuid "480fd893-6a75-5704-903f-fe9945ae2257" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/27/271bcaebb02bc573b2d6c3b00758387ff1a49787270c137f7e69ed3223e7de2b.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186380709} {:answer/id #uuid "a7e4571a-7acf-5877-a904-62367ce6ac1a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/1f/1f87c6b14dba3adad00c49362df7ba03bcbb6f990eba0302bcd10d484f15b070.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186380710} {:answer/id #uuid "e08cd2a9-0dc9-5455-b4d2-241cc812bcb4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/21/21fc0f3e9a2d5100421953ef2270de9d8a99fb395d761b4eb9a3f9f0e1889ac3.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186380711}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b54cebe4-6aa6-502d-9b98-b267d3c2bb70" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/33/33c6c3680f3cab38ffd1508fad160948f3bc1159c01dc287b3fe113c0cf89875.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186380708} :answer-field/id #uuid "08090d20-3972-5c5d-a3b3-2558a12e085f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186380706}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "59a69c0f-c2af-5b88-9b38-1fbc42cfdc3f" :question/math-academy-id "q-122756" :question/problem "Which of the following diagrams represents the vector field $$\n\\displaystyle F(x,y)=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\pi x\\,i+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\left(\\frac{\\pi y}{2}\\right)\\,j\n$$ at the indicated points?" :question/worked-solution "We have to sketch the vector field at the points $(-3,1),(-2,-1),$ and $(4,-4).$\n\nTo sketch the vector field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the function $$\n\\displaystyle F(x,y)=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\pi x\\,i+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\frac{\\pi y}{2}\\,j:\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(-3,1) & =2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi (-3))\\,i+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\left(\\frac{\\pi (1)}{2}\\right)\\,j=-2\\,i+2\\,j \\\\ F(-2,-1) & =2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi (-2))\\,i+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\left(\\frac{\\pi (-1)}{2}\\right)\\,j=2\\,i-2\\,j \\\\ F(4,-4) & =2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi (4))\\,i+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\left(\\frac{\\pi (-4)}{2}\\right)\\,j=2\\,i\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now draw our vectors. At each point, we draw the vector associated with that point, placing the tail end of the vector on the point itself. This gives the following diagram.\n\n![](images/33/33c6c3680f3cab38ffd1508fad160948f3bc1159c01dc287b3fe113c0cf89875.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186256709 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1d9715f6-880f-5e90-9ccb-eb9b334a39ec" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/fc/fc954607d17ae1eadaa0aba8d939343290a5c20f47bf61863cba9c42d9f558c9.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186253919} {:answer/id #uuid "3b6397c3-941a-58f5-887e-447432631c73" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/5e/5e9e75b66969e1acd7b1a90a5243a3a496168644a53d541851ba933a5f465553.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186254186} {:answer/id #uuid "44afdd8c-abe1-588b-af9c-32a4909426e1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/21/2100cd71f6bbbcc46d3f9f35853f65a9bf0d3f25bf3273db0d244c05221d758d.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186254251} {:answer/id #uuid "7fb78a7f-9fd3-5fa7-bde9-8571110c7992" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/34/34e44b959282b0bc6c245643329e2b485d3209d89f304cf76c106718120a2f10.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186254800} {:answer/id #uuid "b3a32930-3699-5cd6-84b0-329514a970d5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/0c/0c69bb201b98cd3728527c562bf4e92cef3c48adae4e01725c2497a73c97a0af.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186255252}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3b6397c3-941a-58f5-887e-447432631c73" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/5e/5e9e75b66969e1acd7b1a90a5243a3a496168644a53d541851ba933a5f465553.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186254186} :answer-field/id #uuid "1f725ff6-094a-5962-a13d-abc513c68fd1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186255975}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "2b3ac067-5818-5125-bedf-bd1f05f196a9" :question/math-academy-id "q-122742" :question/problem "Which of the following diagrams represents the vector field $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)=3\\operatorname{sin}\\left(\\frac{\\pi x}{2}\\right)\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{i}+xy\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{j}$ at the indicated points?" :question/worked-solution "We have to sketch the vector field at the points $(-1,1),(1,2),$ and $(2,-1).$\n\nTo sketch the vector field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the function $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)=3\\operatorname{sin}\\left(\\frac{\\pi x}{2}\\right)\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{i}+xy\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{j}\\hspace{0.167em}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(-1,1) & =3\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\left(-\\frac{\\pi }{2}\\right)\\,i+(-1)(1)\\,j=-3\\,i-j \\\\ F(1,2) & =3\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\left(\\frac{\\pi }{2}\\right)\\,i+(1)(2)\\,j=3\\,i+2\\,j \\\\ F(2,-1) & =3\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi )\\,i+(2)(-1)\\,j=-2\\,j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now draw our vectors. At each point, we draw the vector associated with that point, placing the tail end of the vector on the point itself. This gives the following diagram.\n\n![](images/5e/5e9e75b66969e1acd7b1a90a5243a3a496168644a53d541851ba933a5f465553.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186256710 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "423f3338-ffb1-59f0-b120-219b32a13003" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/48/4837efc1a78060b2954fa58b26f35e7b2c6d810ce676959653f8e7eca0b5b476.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186254234} {:answer/id #uuid "45a53f5e-4056-51ed-a116-9ca60d3c4976" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/e8/e87092c467b78bfe00651fb9752ed54c7f7784c83612fba2149063eba57952e9.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186254259} {:answer/id #uuid "71a298d1-6d06-55e3-ab94-8786b46031d8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/f2/f2835e43d43494d3319a6a0db0a411906f0424bdac8830425bad47723010d95c.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186254679} {:answer/id #uuid "74a2d6dd-b9fa-5a61-ab75-14dcdad78a4c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/68/68d33b11d6476a0d35cb7486073e90e2755b46f1d4f935adc5dafb7087b15b99.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186254702} {:answer/id #uuid "dc946e82-d393-53f9-bc76-247d76947cb9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/58/58a106f2c0ac7aacd30f7ba8915fd2317a67efb73c1c48fe2d192a5d2576717a.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186255626}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "dc946e82-d393-53f9-bc76-247d76947cb9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/58/58a106f2c0ac7aacd30f7ba8915fd2317a67efb73c1c48fe2d192a5d2576717a.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186255626} :answer-field/id #uuid "832d12ed-0f04-5945-adfb-d9b68890f3c4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186256167}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "f0ef3069-54df-58ef-8ea9-a7adc99649e7" :question/math-academy-id "q-122744" :question/problem "Which of the following diagrams represents the vector field $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)=-2x\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{i}+{2}^{y}\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{j}$ at the indicated points?" :question/worked-solution "We have to sketch the vector field at the points $(-4,2),(-1,1),$ and $(2,0).$\n\nTo sketch the vector field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the function $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)=-2x\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{i}+{2}^{y}\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{j}\\hspace{0.167em}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(-4,2) & =-2(-4)\\,i+{2}^{2}\\,j=8\\,i+4\\,j \\\\ F(-1,1) & =-2(-1)\\,i+{2}^{1}\\,j=2\\,i+2\\,j \\\\ F(2,0) & =-2(2)\\,i+{2}^{0}\\,j=-4\\,i+j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now draw our vectors. At each point, we draw the vector associated with that point, placing the tail end of the vector on the point itself. This gives the following diagram.\n\n![](images/58/58a106f2c0ac7aacd30f7ba8915fd2317a67efb73c1c48fe2d192a5d2576717a.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186256712 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "240a8926-bf1a-519e-9693-8f0bba9cbe1b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/b0/b014bb3efef5caa6a721173a7470f4600edc8207cae6adc3a77bffe217176e13.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186253993} {:answer/id #uuid "48068bbf-dbb6-513d-a84e-da2cf1e1b829" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/33/330bf1e0b9b2dff008a3e3878d5b2acba8e14addb637d637874492220cb08f2c.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186254278} {:answer/id #uuid "87cdf628-15c5-5fd3-b604-ae4e78fbbb87" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/81/81ec06546a0ae47f254f42bfafabcf10c6aa7b776f49c59013c9c198bf1bf89a.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186254876} {:answer/id #uuid "c7647169-e091-5477-98ce-5a42c5fd0a32" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/e9/e959a73a075acd0e72e4cfa4edd09fa1710c450286ff574574208d42b2d897c4.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186255450} {:answer/id #uuid "fe49859d-ea70-5353-ac0d-504ccb94fae1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/d1/d150a7172d3a7e876cda685d9b096dd1f8d7d96a3349e355dc26562af75caa47.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186255905}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "48068bbf-dbb6-513d-a84e-da2cf1e1b829" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/33/330bf1e0b9b2dff008a3e3878d5b2acba8e14addb637d637874492220cb08f2c.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186254278} :answer-field/id #uuid "c344638a-8e0e-5a85-a726-eda285835155" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186256266}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "c5565e07-6be0-586e-b2a1-438c9383fcb4" :question/math-academy-id "q-122759" :question/problem "Which of the following diagrams represents the vector field $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)=-\\frac{x}{y}\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{i}-|x|\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{j}$ at the indicated points?" :question/worked-solution "We have to sketch the vector field at the points $(-3,1),(2,-1),$ and $(4,2).$\n\nTo sketch the vector field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the function $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)=-\\frac{x}{y}\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{i}-|x|\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{j}\\hspace{0.167em}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(-3,1) & =-\\left(\\frac{-3}{1}\\right)i-|-3|\\,j=3\\,i-3\\,j \\\\ F(2,-1) & =-\\left(\\frac{2}{-1}\\right)i-|2|\\,j=2\\,i-2\\,j \\\\ F(4,2) & =-\\left(\\frac{4}{2}\\right)i-|4|\\,j=-2\\,i-4\\,j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now draw our vectors. At each point, we draw the vector associated with that point, placing the tail end of the vector on the point itself. This gives the following diagram.\n\n![](images/33/330bf1e0b9b2dff008a3e3878d5b2acba8e14addb637d637874492220cb08f2c.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186380712 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "68c8f22e-9c72-5097-9d66-15b73bc21b48" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/d2/d28dd5c26019ddf8dd9fa1c3034eed957cc5d62e433989d966f34c1623494966.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186380714} {:answer/id #uuid "3bb393e8-f46f-59f9-bd05-a8b537c8b025" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/b8/b896ff19664a92b34fd8456077b4a91ea2d36121c284001adfbf8216fc49a46c.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186380715} {:answer/id #uuid "b072cbaa-a0b3-5627-bae1-8d307f2b14e2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/b9/b96b3f9db529d096b96321e3efe9d645788c763373cfeeaeac559c343215e11a.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186380716} {:answer/id #uuid "9b6da738-e5c8-5567-b9f8-3a0e4086fc28" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/b0/b0b3eced37ace6c64c65cf94c1621d6706894a079621870b19a69b0f27f2c842.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186380717} {:answer/id #uuid "8558fc22-266f-5df8-9ed9-f72208859a20" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/d1/d1fc9c2797e0fa16ba0c6b8f9328680c3706c118d5ed576d09be48e5068537fe.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186380718}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9b6da738-e5c8-5567-b9f8-3a0e4086fc28" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/b0/b0b3eced37ace6c64c65cf94c1621d6706894a079621870b19a69b0f27f2c842.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186380717} :answer-field/id #uuid "34658309-80b9-58e6-8164-617fe6aa19b1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186380713}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "30d646c9-1021-587c-bc37-6244d8e4d4a6" :question/math-academy-id "q-122764" :question/problem "Which of the following diagrams represents the vector field $$\n\\displaystyle F(x,y)=\\frac{2y}{1-y}\\,i+\\frac{x}{y-1}\\,j\n$$ at the indicated points?" :question/worked-solution "We have to sketch the vector field at the points $(-2,3),(2,-1),$ and $(4,2).$\n\nTo sketch the vector field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the function $$\n\\displaystyle F(x,y)=\\frac{2y}{1-y}\\,i+\\frac{x}{y-1}\\,j\\,:\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(-2,3) & =\\frac{2(3)}{1-3}\\,i+\\frac{-2}{3-1}\\,j=-3\\,i-j \\\\ F(2,-1) & =\\frac{2(-1)}{1-(-1)}\\,i+\\frac{2}{(-1)-1}\\,j=-i-j \\\\ F(4,2) & =\\frac{2(2)}{1-2}\\,i+\\frac{4}{2-1}\\,j=-4\\,i+4\\,j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now draw our vectors. At each point, we draw the vector associated with that point, placing the tail end of the vector on the point itself. This gives the following diagram.\n\n![](images/b0/b0b3eced37ace6c64c65cf94c1621d6706894a079621870b19a69b0f27f2c842.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186387277 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "de1513c2-3155-5def-a5b5-5b833a833652" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/b6/b6a7c1faba2bb5d18d5f729d2576d7475f6ce1784698fae0a1c1ea97b80d6180.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387279} {:answer/id #uuid "f9bf0d9a-d009-5dbb-8f91-ece881c3e02c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/d4/d44395fa166c654c41322bd31e1a9bf9bc6c7a398e27da7f9de9d249ccdb1107.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387280} {:answer/id #uuid "0b6544d5-cd56-547b-895e-df2376403680" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/8c/8cdc92839252560ad52b54bb77d9db75ba066e33bfa5a3c451e4cbb6345e9d33.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387281} {:answer/id #uuid "8bade9cb-3b17-5e2f-ab51-5cbf5f1198f6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/25/2560beb4dcff267890c47ad5df8ac7aef0e5de64a57384f8c71e35d8325c892b.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387282} {:answer/id #uuid "45a0eeab-6f8a-5b04-8150-613eb8858a86" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/8e/8ec9af02a374c1b8a954117ad055f78e9e2ac74bc391bb230968198a3a474fef.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387283}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "45a0eeab-6f8a-5b04-8150-613eb8858a86" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/8e/8ec9af02a374c1b8a954117ad055f78e9e2ac74bc391bb230968198a3a474fef.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387283} :answer-field/id #uuid "bc3d49d5-a5f3-575b-83f9-afd438ed4ffd" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387278}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "7e446a55-b0d3-59f4-abde-52af19baebe8" :question/math-academy-id "q-122745" :question/problem "Which of the following diagrams represents the vector field $$\n\\displaystyle F(x,y)=\\frac{y}{xy+1}\\,i+\\frac{x}{xy+1}\\,j\n$$ at the indicated points?" :question/worked-solution "We have to sketch the vector field at the points $(-2,0),(1,-2),$ and $(0,2).$\n\nTo sketch the vector field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the function $$\n\\displaystyle F(x,y)=\\frac{y}{xy+1}\\,i+\\frac{x}{xy+1}\\,j\\,:\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(-2,0) & =\\frac{0}{(-2)(0)+1}\\,i+\\frac{-2}{(-2)(0)+1}\\,j=-2\\,j \\\\ F(1,-2) & =\\frac{-2}{(1)(-2)+1}\\,i+\\frac{1}{(1)(-2)+1}\\,j=2\\,i-j \\\\ F(0,2) & =\\frac{2}{(0)(2)+1}\\,i+\\frac{0}{(0)(2)+1}\\,j=2\\,i\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now draw our vectors. At each point, we draw the vector associated with that point, placing the tail end of the vector on the point itself. This gives the following diagram.\n\n![](images/8e/8ec9af02a374c1b8a954117ad055f78e9e2ac74bc391bb230968198a3a474fef.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186387284 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a9a9e026-4bc7-575e-be23-f281b7660b3f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/d6/d688cdc804635688df6780bfb674622a491528c85802397cc3dccb6bd4a2d6be.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387286} {:answer/id #uuid "60880678-2b0d-57f7-8c8d-ae95a3c4b0f9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/1f/1f597a7886abe6a8cddca9192658c8ded57dd96b010dfbf166e8cea6484872e7.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387287} {:answer/id #uuid "71e0ba0c-ade1-5e87-9ac1-d66c6f763265" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/11/114f65bec341c3bef23ffda186b7d5a721e89e607d15c64624b6145e734c68c0.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387288} {:answer/id #uuid "4150b677-4ab5-5642-97f3-e462d77d1b78" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/8b/8b20800589467fa460547519312ed283d373ce2b7553b0c397413799b2d6597f.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387289} {:answer/id #uuid "bcafb174-7327-5bc3-a3a6-55a1c3530cdc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/53/5317b575c101e4a782e17f9f83f56f66f8151a1d1c12cd0084020429435ba542.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387290}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a9a9e026-4bc7-575e-be23-f281b7660b3f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/d6/d688cdc804635688df6780bfb674622a491528c85802397cc3dccb6bd4a2d6be.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387286} :answer-field/id #uuid "eb7e4ea8-2187-5984-93cd-b8162a3b3097" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387285}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "709ee56e-badf-53e5-8fe9-cd6e97119ca1" :question/math-academy-id "q-122752" :question/problem "Which of the following diagrams represents the vector field $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)=(y-2x)\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{i}+(2y-4x)\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{j}$ at the indicated points?" :question/worked-solution "We have to sketch the vector field at the points $(1,3),(-1,-1),$ and $(3,2).$\n\nTo sketch the vector field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the function $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)=(y-2x)\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{i}+(2y-4x)\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{j}\\hspace{0.167em}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(1,3) & =(3-2(1))\\,i+(2(3)-4(1))\\,j=i+2\\,j \\\\ F(-1,-1) & =(-1-2(-1))\\,i+(2(-1)-4(-1))\\,j=i+2\\,j \\\\ F(3,2) & =(2-2(3))\\,i+(2(2)-4(3))\\,j=-4\\,i-8\\,j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now draw our vectors. At each point, we draw the vector associated with that point, placing the tail end of the vector on the point itself. This gives the following diagram.\n\n![](images/d6/d688cdc804635688df6780bfb674622a491528c85802397cc3dccb6bd4a2d6be.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186387291 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d40339cb-9f8c-56b1-9446-2bb79c2ae322" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/4c/4c9fc6ae3cbbf6fa3d241d3607b26fee1cd0670fde37494638ca90da2b02ecfa.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387293} {:answer/id #uuid "3b36441e-f03d-5f2c-b78a-49b57116a3cb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/d6/d6084f0711f728a09a78c9803bec9c6e54274d6d72a2adc2b1547651e0ec702c.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387294} {:answer/id #uuid "116d6c88-d5ff-5163-b1bc-a148e6194baf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/3e/3e9efea8998b1dbaab3cc6d89dce4f99bdb06066e81fcb78a2b3a0e412e2e44c.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387295} {:answer/id #uuid "e73588d4-0678-5e1c-aac4-ffad61b46f23" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/80/80ecb3a560bc23359c3b44baace0523bfe653f0c5a5fee5b5c646d901ade5feb.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387296} {:answer/id #uuid "d1c0c612-25c2-5765-8c88-fa1c6a482813" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/04/040d62d956945b7bb67cae560cda4e09a22be2fa9cd2e5da3f3cc372269f14e4.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387297}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3b36441e-f03d-5f2c-b78a-49b57116a3cb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/d6/d6084f0711f728a09a78c9803bec9c6e54274d6d72a2adc2b1547651e0ec702c.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387294} :answer-field/id #uuid "c92e3f54-7df7-528f-9e7f-fbd995c31ee0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387292}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "5b5b3650-421e-53e6-b6b4-9b4c7a243072" :question/math-academy-id "q-122754" :question/problem "Which of the following diagrams represents the vector field $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)=(y-2)\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{i}+(x+2)\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{j}$ at the indicated points?" :question/worked-solution "We have to sketch the vector field at the points $(-5,3),(0,0),$ and $(2,-3).$\n\nTo sketch the vector field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the function $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)=(y-2)\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{i}+(x+2)\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{j}\\hspace{0.167em}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(-5,3) & =(3-2)\\,i+(-5+2)\\,j=i-3\\,j \\\\ F(0,0) & =(0-2)\\,i+(0+2)\\,j=-2\\,i+2\\,j \\\\ F(2,-3) & =(-3-2)\\,i+(2+2)\\,j=-5\\,i+4\\,j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now draw our vectors. At each point, we draw the vector associated with that point, placing the tail end of the vector on the point itself. This gives the following diagram.\n\n![](images/d6/d6084f0711f728a09a78c9803bec9c6e54274d6d72a2adc2b1547651e0ec702c.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186417343 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "49e846d3-cfa4-53b9-966f-e4adab0cb729" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/1d/1d502f64bd89571fcd7ccb43e339b0fb8554ebf2072d48eaf10829f96f9c170e.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186417331} {:answer/id #uuid "acf72fee-ab09-5c2f-a567-2d99703c6cb0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/ea/eac1fe8c8dee7394a49603187829adcc0fa81665e0eafb2674f43ebdf4493f10.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186417334} {:answer/id #uuid "b10e879c-3c4a-5dd0-9361-bbc17fe37c13" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/5d/5d27f4544c601da995ad2c1402547a477a244a6b79bff4e8b79f945299b73b87.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186417335} {:answer/id #uuid "cf5ff7a9-5c75-54e7-82a4-5ae809e4f3a9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/e4/e40599ebb674fe5fe05c60be75f148f41458469ae6926c3388675ecdb24f66cf.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186417337} {:answer/id #uuid "d640a56e-f8d2-517d-a8ab-e60c9f56c036" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/59/59bf689a32a8a0c5d347f29065acea60194b9f4b0fad084108ecb657257cd939.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186417338}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cf5ff7a9-5c75-54e7-82a4-5ae809e4f3a9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/e4/e40599ebb674fe5fe05c60be75f148f41458469ae6926c3388675ecdb24f66cf.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186417337} :answer-field/id #uuid "b10e9eb4-ee70-5020-8593-2fc167326803" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186417341}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "d04f0b91-140d-549f-8f9d-31d1d9b6c7bc" :question/math-academy-id "q-122758" :question/problem "Which of the following diagrams represents the vector field $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)=-x\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{i}-y\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{j}$ at the indicated points?" :question/worked-solution "We have to sketch the vector field at the points $(1,4),(2,-2),$ and $(4,-2).$\n\nTo sketch the vector field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the function $F(x,y)=-x\\,i-y\\,j\\,:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(1,4) & =-(1)\\,i-4\\,j=-i-4\\,j \\\\ F(2,-2) & =-(2)\\,i-(-2)\\,j=-2\\,i+2\\,j \\\\ F(4,-2) & =-(4)\\,i-(-2)\\,j=-4\\,i+2\\,j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now draw our vectors. At each point, we draw the vector associated with that point, placing the tail end of the vector on the point itself. This gives the following diagram.\n\n![](images/e4/e40599ebb674fe5fe05c60be75f148f41458469ae6926c3388675ecdb24f66cf.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186518763 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1cd0dcd1-823c-5bfe-a3b4-87f697bc1cc5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/88/88d6157b6d961bfcfe66f9d0635c7c75e754fa33d182971f3e8722821995a7bf.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518772} {:answer/id #uuid "3522f0ef-1ff6-5054-b459-1bc1a99959f3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/e2/e23ab97241e392652578b744558f27abf17a6f10887b4532bfd9198a0168d6de.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518778} {:answer/id #uuid "6a0ad3fe-aab5-5c80-a718-10250bc0a44b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/0f/0f22b1314960b7ddc22461df115e3cc8b883f463e39e0717f494486c9145c461.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518791} {:answer/id #uuid "7500cd0d-e37b-5f4b-928d-4f02799db350" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/8b/8bdff7dd1b78b495112bb64fcf8c7f88eaa5434924c248654afb645f9146db17.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518794} {:answer/id #uuid "935a7585-1072-568f-8a0c-50849d049cac" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/00/00fae4ff8c65eb9be03ec51e68ddf89e03122c366feefa1cc2f370d2fea8b789.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518808}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7500cd0d-e37b-5f4b-928d-4f02799db350" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/8b/8bdff7dd1b78b495112bb64fcf8c7f88eaa5434924c248654afb645f9146db17.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518794} :answer-field/id #uuid "07507bc4-4f53-51a3-a550-08f3dc917fb9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518765}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "014ab122-2134-517b-b9a9-d71b60e66dee" :question/problem "Which of the following diagrams represents the vector field $F(x,y)=-2 x y\\,i-x^{2}\\,j$ at the indicated points?" :question/worked-solution "We have to sketch the vector field at the points $(-1,\\frac{3}{2}),(-2,- \\frac{3}{2}),$ and $(-2,\\frac{1}{2}).$\n\nTo sketch the vector field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the function $F(x,y)=-2 x y\\,i-x^{2}\\,j\\,:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(-1,\\frac{3}{2}) & =\\left((-2)(-1)\\left(\\frac{3}{2}\\right)\\right)\\,i+\\left((-1)(-1)^{2}\\right)\\,j=3\\,i-j \\\\ F(-2,- \\frac{3}{2}) & =\\left((-2)(-2)\\left(- \\frac{3}{2}\\right)\\right)\\,i+\\left((-1)(-2)^{2}\\right)\\,j=-6\\,i-4\\,j \\\\ F(-2,\\frac{1}{2}) & =\\left((-2)(-2)\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\right)\\,i+\\left((-1)(-2)^{2}\\right)\\,j=2\\,i-4\\,j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now draw our vectors. At each point, we draw the vector associated with that point, placing the tail end of the vector on the point itself. This gives the following diagram.\n\n![](images/8b/8bdff7dd1b78b495112bb64fcf8c7f88eaa5434924c248654afb645f9146db17.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186518771 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4a304352-c54f-51ef-8906-32ee9cdc8b79" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/6c/6c75e8fe5ad41fd863eca4152c172bbba3084eba38b6e54c96f9e084669279ca.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518783} {:answer/id #uuid "67f43eb9-dbc2-5820-b523-2f926f10b9fa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/e8/e829b1ebe911b3c3ae1a6e871d10a36931fef7f950933abda5ea226fd4c9ae66.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518790} {:answer/id #uuid "6f17cf54-8843-57c9-a3d9-0c5e55c95936" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/09/09fee256ed52affac40d46982cdb3b2e3957677e81ec0aa3266d9885be9e1add.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518792} {:answer/id #uuid "773a8b98-66de-5e5e-b398-a5e44ac67b13" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/5d/5decd9cc7f7088571cf3eecf9f50c7ec87e2f6182df1fbc4b55caaf8bc3e73d4.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518795} {:answer/id #uuid "d2fa96a1-5147-5de1-b5da-a48e24f11b60" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/26/267f2a39c365664697da7256d49767c2018b3f63d94a6f55e90b566cc554a27e.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518822}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "67f43eb9-dbc2-5820-b523-2f926f10b9fa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/e8/e829b1ebe911b3c3ae1a6e871d10a36931fef7f950933abda5ea226fd4c9ae66.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518790} :answer-field/id #uuid "d55fcac1-f13e-5aca-8efd-d6b03f32a8f6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518823}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "1b8d00f8-3412-52c9-9322-b2ebe7eaa245" :question/problem "Which of the following diagrams represents the vector field $F(x,y)=2 x y\\,i-2 x^{2}\\,j$ at the indicated points?" :question/worked-solution "We have to sketch the vector field at the points $(2,\\frac{1}{2}),(-2,- \\frac{3}{2}),$ and $(2,- \\frac{3}{2}).$\n\nTo sketch the vector field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the function $F(x,y)=2 x y\\,i-2 x^{2}\\,j\\,:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(2,\\frac{1}{2}) & =\\left((2)(2)\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\right)\\,i+\\left((-2)(2)^{2}\\right)\\,j=2\\,i-8\\,j \\\\ F(-2,- \\frac{3}{2}) & =\\left((2)(-2)\\left(- \\frac{3}{2}\\right)\\right)\\,i+\\left((-2)(-2)^{2}\\right)\\,j=6\\,i-8\\,j \\\\ F(2,- \\frac{3}{2}) & =\\left((2)(2)\\left(- \\frac{3}{2}\\right)\\right)\\,i+\\left((-2)(2)^{2}\\right)\\,j=-6\\,i-8\\,j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now draw our vectors. At each point, we draw the vector associated with that point, placing the tail end of the vector on the point itself. This gives the following diagram.\n\n![](images/e8/e829b1ebe911b3c3ae1a6e871d10a36931fef7f950933abda5ea226fd4c9ae66.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186518775 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0deeee54-5137-5ac3-b9b4-0f091bb47502" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/07/07235837dbd839f3603359295ecae29383f96956b0d5724fab8fcfb053dbfd46.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518768} {:answer/id #uuid "8e1efae7-38d6-5363-b86d-fd79f952e5d3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/8e/8e3a8f6c8b863dd68bc426baf82151476a347d231f87a763199288b93cdf585c.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518801} {:answer/id #uuid "923fd78a-1c49-58e4-81a3-5a3d262a0a0d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/61/61fff51ff54e097ae5a320948e16d1f93f1bbc1c5a170206b016dbcca1cb4fa5.png" 