e tail end of the vector on the point itself. This gives the following diagram.\n\n![](images/8e/8e3a8f6c8b863dd68bc426baf82151476a347d231f87a763199288b93cdf585c.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186518781 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "20376de9-73cc-5220-b1b5-d05e47b251ad" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/34/34fe0d8361633cbf6a7242584878f75edce90dbf4a353e74c4f3ecb5ff3540b3.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518773} {:answer/id #uuid "2325b410-0c6c-5f57-bcd5-530841a89169" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/0d/0d2feddba8eb9c880f7a0dfd88b2b1f936f8bfa1de33f205c408fd776a33a579.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518774} {:answer/id #uuid "530c6a59-3daa-5170-80e7-2ad2212a0376" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/3f/3f6994b60e754eea32fa80912a8f97d52489cf40afeb1ed8302c735114c435fa.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518785} {:answer/id #uuid "8f54eaf6-17e9-532e-9a19-52e471db13d6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/06/06e549a074498c1965de40b8e169788d1f17b345eb4d0b6ac0f3448f5ea0d836.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518802} {:answer/id #uuid "922d439f-5c84-51e8-8470-495005da2288" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/00/0078b7d156dd5970e03f8397336ec07658f1b314a6d7da856c20dfba0dcebd8c.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518805}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2325b410-0c6c-5f57-bcd5-530841a89169" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/0d/0d2feddba8eb9c880f7a0dfd88b2b1f936f8bfa1de33f205c408fd776a33a579.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518774} :answer-field/id #uuid "ba38c6cb-2e18-5cec-833d-5f3d7771d213" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518820}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "4806298d-deed-5b7f-9dfb-a11102a6c5d3" :question/problem "Which of the following diagrams represents the vector field $F(x,y)=2 x y\\,i-x^{2}\\,j$ at the indicated points?" :question/worked-solution "We have to sketch the vector field at the points $(-2,\\frac{3}{2}),(1,- \\frac{1}{2}),$ and $(-1,\\frac{3}{2}).$\n\nTo sketch the vector field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the function $F(x,y)=2 x y\\,i-x^{2}\\,j\\,:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(-2,\\frac{3}{2}) & =\\left((2)(-2)\\left(\\frac{3}{2}\\right)\\right)\\,i+\\left((-1)(-2)^{2}\\right)\\,j=-6\\,i-4\\,j \\\\ F(1,- \\frac{1}{2}) & =\\left((2)(1)\\left(- \\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\right)\\,i+\\left((-1)(1)^{2}\\right)\\,j=-i-j \\\\ F(-1,\\frac{3}{2}) & =\\left((2)(-1)\\left(\\frac{3}{2}\\right)\\right)\\,i+\\left((-1)(-1)^{2}\\right)\\,j=-3\\,i-j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now draw our vectors. At each point, we draw the vector associated with that point, placing the tail end of the vector on the point itself. This gives the following diagram.\n\n![](images/0d/0d2feddba8eb9c880f7a0dfd88b2b1f936f8bfa1de33f205c408fd776a33a579.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186518789 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0f24afde-307e-5a68-9ef6-d776f89a190a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/cc/ccaa50fb2c18d3f4f320dfebfaa34522a32a50b8fa0c4bea641f158367716437.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518769} {:answer/id #uuid "279db652-c9e6-5660-a30a-c3664e796959" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/f1/f1825366a93acf5c83c83973d9689d919e5e4a27a3db7fe31bca95afe0dfef78.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518776} {:answer/id #uuid "4792412b-7e7a-5172-9926-7e53c39b704f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/2c/2cdf71a7faea6652cca5c0b87916f6a6ce2f622dfb5a668b386a5c1bf2567d23.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518780} {:answer/id #uuid "5cb11845-5440-5f8e-ab38-09080147e291" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/86/866186b6f6f18cca7832b0da458fbd08f01a6cb7d618f2a904f50885eb2e3f0f.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518788} {:answer/id #uuid "a099f06e-ecd1-50f5-8536-1f98184ff8e2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/f6/f686e6a5920875ee373ced37fa6fcac941dc3fbd54489f16d4f27c3ff996b2e8.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518813}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5cb11845-5440-5f8e-ab38-09080147e291" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/86/866186b6f6f18cca7832b0da458fbd08f01a6cb7d618f2a904f50885eb2e3f0f.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518788} :answer-field/id #uuid "f8b11a11-c4c5-5c9c-a8c5-b16ef6212efd" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518830}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "664de91a-fae2-5c4e-bcb3-71dd355525c5" :question/problem "Which of the following diagrams represents the vector field $F(x,y)=-2 x y\\,i-x^{2}\\,j$ at the indicated points?" :question/worked-solution "We have to sketch the vector field at the points $(-1,\\frac{5}{4}),(-2,- \\frac{5}{4}),$ and $(-2,\\frac{3}{4}).$\n\nTo sketch the vector field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the function $F(x,y)=-2 x y\\,i-x^{2}\\,j\\,:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(-1,\\frac{5}{4}) & =\\left((-2)(-1)\\left(\\frac{5}{4}\\right)\\right)\\,i+\\left((-1)(-1)^{2}\\right)\\,j=\\frac{5}{2}\\,i-j \\\\ F(-2,- \\frac{5}{4}) & =\\left((-2)(-2)\\left(- \\frac{5}{4}\\right)\\right)\\,i+\\left((-1)(-2)^{2}\\right)\\,j=-5\\,i-4\\,j \\\\ F(-2,\\frac{3}{4}) & =\\left((-2)(-2)\\left(\\frac{3}{4}\\right)\\right)\\,i+\\left((-1)(-2)^{2}\\right)\\,j=3\\,i-4\\,j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now draw our vectors. At each point, we draw the vector associated with that point, placing the tail end of the vector on the point itself. This gives the following diagram.\n\n![](images/86/866186b6f6f18cca7832b0da458fbd08f01a6cb7d618f2a904f50885eb2e3f0f.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186518796 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid 